. do example.do

. * nwcommands tutorial 12: dyads, triads and motifs
. * Requires the core nwcommands.
. nwwebuse sampson, nwclear

. nwsummarize samplike
--------------------------------------------------
   Network name:  samplike
   Network id:  4
   Directed: true
   Valued: true
   Two-mode: false
   Nodes: 18
   Selfloop: false
   Arcs: 88
   Minimum value:  0
   Maximum value:  3
   Density:  .288
   Temporal: false

. 
. * 1. The dyad census
. nwdyads samplike
(note: tie values are ignored; this measure is binary)

    Dyad census:  samplike

    Mutual |      Asym |      Null
-----------+-----------+-----------
        28 |        32 |        93
 
    Reciprocity: .467

. 
